# Build-time environment for production builds (`next build` loads this file
# ahead of `.env` whenever NODE_ENV=production). Committed on purpose — it
# holds no secrets, only the public identity of the site.
#
# Why this file has to exist: `.dockerignore` keeps `.env` out of the deploy
# build container (correctly — it has real local credentials in it), so inside
# the container NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL was simply unset and SITE_URL fell back to
# "http://localhost:3000" (src/lib/seo.ts). Page metadata still came out right
# because the panel sets the variable at runtime, but /sitemap.xml and
# /robots.txt are prerendered at build time, so they shipped with localhost
# URLs in them and told Google the wrong thing (issue #28).
#
# The canonical host is the bare domain over https — no "www". Both hosts
# answer, so keep this in sync with whatever the panel's runtime value is, or
# the static and dynamic surfaces will disagree again.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="https://kkdproperty.co.th"

# CookieYes consent-banner id (public identifier, not a secret — it ships in
# every page's HTML regardless). src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx's own comment
# claims reading this in a Server Component avoids build-time inlining and
# lets the panel's runtime value control it — that's Next's documented
# behaviour for a purely dynamic render, but this layout apparently still
# gets statically optimized (same fallback-to-missing failure mode as
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL above): built without this var present anywhere on the
# build machine, the banner silently stopped rendering in production —
# meaning no visitor could grant consent, meaning kkd_ref/kkd_utm attribution
# silently stopped working too, since both are consent-gated. Caught during
# post-deploy verification on 2026-08-16, not by the layout comment's own
# reasoning. Keep this value in sync with the panel's; if the panel's changes
# (e.g. banner disabled by clearing it there), update this too and rebuild —
# clearing only the panel side no longer has any effect on its own.
NEXT_PUBLIC_COOKIEYES_ID="ebaf06b6a5fed3292f124e8e29195a7c"
